WEBVTT

00:03.720 --> 00:06.080
Your servant greets Your Majesty

00:07.440 --> 00:08.640
Rise

00:08.720 --> 00:09.560
Help me change clothes

00:09.640 --> 00:11.040
Thank you, Your Majesty

00:11.600 --> 00:12.760
Your Majesty

00:12.840 --> 00:15.000
What kind of incense do you use?

00:15.080 --> 00:17.400
It's so fragrant, Your Majesty

00:19.400 --> 00:20.800
Your Majesty

00:21.360 --> 00:22.520
I suddenly remembered

00:22.600 --> 00:23.600
There are still some things I haven't done

00:23.680 --> 00:25.080
What things?

00:26.640 --> 00:28.040
Your Majesty

00:30.080 --> 00:30.880
Fan Zhong

00:30.960 --> 00:31.600
What is that?

00:31.680 --> 00:32.840
That is the eldest daughter of the great chieftain

00:32.920 --> 00:34.000
From Longzhou in the northwest who submitted

00:34.080 --> 00:35.400
If Your Majesty humiliates her like this

00:35.480 --> 00:36.360
I'm afraid Longxi

00:36.440 --> 00:37.680
Will cause trouble again

00:37.840 --> 00:38.400
Your Majesty

00:38.480 --> 00:39.880
Please think twice

00:56.000 --> 00:57.320
Your Majesty

00:57.400 --> 00:58.800
Your Majesty, you've returned

00:59.160 --> 01:00.240
Your Majesty

01:00.320 --> 01:02.000
As long as you close your eyes

01:02.160 --> 01:04.320
I can still give you pleasure

01:04.400 --> 01:05.800
Your Majesty

01:06.560 --> 01:07.840
Attend the bedchamber

01:07.920 --> 01:09.280
Right away

